  "bodyHash": "0a4hGo+jsZs=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">一個精心整理的模組包，讓你可以暢玩各種魔法模組，享受快樂時光！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">只有大約 100 個模組，所以不像那些 250+ 的大型模組包那麼吃資源。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">這個模組包包含了多種魔法模組，例如：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>血魔法</strong> - 用於各種瘋狂的「血魔法」</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>植物魔法</strong> - 享受和平又有趣的花卉魔法</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Psi</strong> - 來自 Irregular Magic High School 的科技魔法</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>星輝魔法</strong> - 運用星星的力量</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><em>還有更多！</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">同時也包含了以下模組：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Mekanism</strong> - 滿足你對一般科技模組的需求</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>沉浸工程</strong> - 體驗蒸氣龐克風格的科技</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>精緻儲存</strong> - 提供更美觀且更易使用的 AE2 儲存系統</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>日式建築方塊</strong> - 為什麼不呢？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><em>還有更多！</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>模組列表：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bookshelf\" rel=\"nofollow\">書櫃 (作者：DarkhaxDev)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI（物品欄管理器） (作者：mezz)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/japanese-building-blocks\" rel=\"nofollow\">日式建築方塊 (作者：MrNoerGlugger)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism 附加組件 (作者：bradyaidanc)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refined-storage-addons\" rel=\"nofollow\">精緻儲存附加 (作者：raoulvdberge)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botany-trees\" rel=\"nofollow\">植物學樹木 (作者：DarkhaxDev)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/woot\" rel=\"nofollow\">Woot (作者：Ipsis)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/light-overlay\" rel=\"nofollow\">光照疊層（Rift/Forge/Fabric） (作者：shedaniel)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-essentials\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Essentials (作者：FTB)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ctm\" rel=\"nofollow\">連接紋理模組 (作者：tterrag1098)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/engineers-decor\" rel=\"nofollow\"