trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury（Forge） (作者：shedaniel)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-gui-library\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB GUI 庫 (作者：FTB)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-teams\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB 團隊 (作者：FTB)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquary-v1-3\" rel=\"nofollow\">聖物 v1.3 (作者：P3pp3rF1y)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeon-crawl\" rel=\"nofollow\">地牢探索 (作者：XIROC1337)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">布料配置 API（Forge） (作者：shedaniel)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" rel=\"nofollow\">傳送石碑 (作者：BlayTheNinth)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ai-improvements\" rel=\"nofollow\">AI 改進 (作者：DarkGuardsman)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wawla\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wawla - 我們在看什麼 (作者：DarkhaxDev)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/u-team-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">U Team 核心 (作者：HyCraftHD)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"